                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>🎮</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>Æ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Unispace' fontsize='14'>Action and Shooter games lead globally but not everywhere.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Cascadia Code' fontsize='12'>North America and Europe clearly favor high-adrenaline titles.But Japan’s top genre? Role-Playing.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Cascadia Code' fontsize='12'>This regional split highlights the importance of cultural preference when localizing releases.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Unispace' fontsize='12'>Insight: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Cascadia Code' fontsize='12'>One-size-fits-all marketing won’t cut it. GameCo can drive smarter sales by tailoring releases to each region’s taste.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
