    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='D5 – From Data to Strategy'>
      <style>
        <style-rule element='table'>
          <format attr='background-color' value='#000354' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size sizing-mode='automatic' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='27' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='98214' id='24' is-scaled='1' param='C:/Users/Ripple/Downloads/10.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='99058' x='471' y='893'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='52344' id='3' type-v2='text' w='44405' x='6007' y='23884'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Unispace' fontsize='14' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>🔍 </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Unispace' fontsize='14' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>What the Data Revealed</run>
            <run lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Cascadia Code' fontsize='12' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Game genres aren’t one size fits all. Regional tastes matter. The industry hit its peak in the late 2000s, but sales slowed as players shifted to mobile, digital platforms, and new play styles. Meanwhile, just a handful of publishers dominate global sales. That means GameCo needs to think differently to compete.</run>
            <run lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Unispace' fontsize='14' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>🧠 </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Unispace' fontsize='14' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>What GameCo Can Do</run>
            <run lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Cascadia Code' fontsize='12' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>• Focus on region specific genre strategy instead of global launches</run>
            <run lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Cascadia Code' fontsize='12' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>• Analyze platform shifts and prepare for the next wave: cloud, mobile, indie</run>
            <run lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Cascadia Code' fontsize='12' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>• Build partnerships or IPs that create player loyalty beyond the first purchase</run>
            <run lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Unispace' fontsize='12' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>⚠ </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Unispace' fontsize='12' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Remember:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Unispace' fontsize='12' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ </run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Cascadia Code' fontsize='12' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>The market is evolving fast. What worked in 2009 will not work in 2025. Strategy backed by data is your edge.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
