                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Unispace' fontsize='14' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>🔍 </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Unispace' fontsize='14' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>What the Data Revealed</run>
                    <run lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Cascadia Code' fontsize='12' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Game genres aren’t one size fits all. Regional tastes matter. The industry hit its peak in the late 2000s, but sales slowed as players shifted to mobile, digital platforms, and new play styles. Meanwhile, just a handful of publishers dominate global sales. That means GameCo needs to think differently to compete.</run>
                    <run lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Unispace' fontsize='14' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>🧠 </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Unispace' fontsize='14' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>What GameCo Can Do</run>
