                    <run lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Cascadia Code' fontsize='12' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>• Build partnerships or IPs that create player loyalty beyond the first purchase</run>
                    <run lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Unispace' fontsize='12' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>⚠ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Unispace' fontsize='12' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Remember:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Unispace' fontsize='12' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Cascadia Code' fontsize='12' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>The market is evolving fast. What worked in 2009 will not work in 2025. Strategy backed by data is your edge.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
